 919:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h **** /**
 920:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @brief  Configure Parity (enabled/disabled and parity mode if enabled).
 921:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @note   This function selects if hardware parity control (generation and detection) is enabled 
 922:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         When the parity control is enabled (Odd or Even), computed parity bit is inserted at th
 923:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         (9th or 8th bit depending on data width) and parity is checked on the received data.
 924:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @rmtoll CR1          PS            LL_USART_SetParity\n
 925:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         CR1          PCE           LL_USART_SetParity
